 "summary": "The 42WKN cassette controller has a built-in RS-485 port that runs BACnet MS/TP or Modbus RTU, chosen with DIP switch SW3.8 (on = BACnet). The object list has 105 objects: sensor inputs, valve and fan outputs, setpoints, mode, fan speed, occupancy and PID/fan-speed tuning values, and binary values for on/off, keypad locks and input polarity.",
